title: [+ year_display +] [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] Conference 
subtitle: Sedgewick faces internal opposition.
